  "body": "### Summary\nAs a member whose session had expired at launch, I want the lists to see me logged in as soon as I reconnect, so that the Favoris/Suivis/Lus filter and the hidden categories come back without my pulling to refresh the Catégories list.\n\n### Scenario\n1. Launch with the current account's session expired: the home page is fetched logged out (`ForumListContent.isLoggedIn == false`).\n2. Account menu › \"Se reconnecter\", correct password: the session is valid.\n3. Every topic list still loads as logged out: the filter is forced to \"Tous\", the scope bar says \"Connexion requise pour Favoris, Suivis et Lus…\", the Apple category stays hidden.\n4. This lasts until the member pulls to refresh Catégories; someone living in the Favoris tab on iPhone may never do it.\nThe reverse holds too: a session that expires in place keeps `isLoggedIn() == true`. `MessageListModel` and `MPStorageSyncModel` ask the session and the account row shows `AccountSessionStatus`: three sources that can disagree.\n\n### Evidence (`7a61018f`)\n- `App/SwiftHFR/Navigation/NavigationModel.swift:83-86`: `if let known = forums.loader.value?.isLoggedIn { return known }`, the session only as a fallback.\n- `App/SwiftHFR/Navigation/TopicListModel.swift:288-289`: `let loggedIn = await isLoggedIn()`, `let filter = hasFilter && loggedIn ? chosenFilter : .all`.\n- `App/SwiftHFR/Accounts/AccountsModel.swift:239-242, 274, 447-451`: a re-login of an existing account renews the same `HFRSession`, so the session generation does not change and `RootView` keeps its `RootModel`.\n- The forum list loads only through `loadIfNeeded` (`Root/RootNavigationView.swift:40`, `Navigation/ForumListView.swift:43`) and reloads only on pull-to-refresh (`ForumListView.swift:42`).\n- Existing tests pin each half: `NavigationModelTests.loggedInStateComesFromTheForumListOnceLoaded`, `AccountsModelLoginTests.reloginRenewsTheAccountsOwnSessionAndKeepsTheCurrentAccount`; none crosses them.\n\n### Fix\nOne source of truth: `AccountsModel` exposes a \"current session renewed\" counter and the root reloads `model.forums` (then the visible lists) when it changes; or `NavigationModel.isLoggedIn()` ignores a forum page older than the last login or expiry.\n\n### Test (fails before the fix)\n`NavigationModelTests.aReloginInPlaceMakesTheListsLoggedInWithoutAManualRefresh`: scripted data source (home logged out, re-login signalled, topic list load): the request carries the chosen filter and `offersFilter == true`.\n\nRelated: #824 (logged-out prompts). Rework model: Sonnet 5.5, reviewed by Opus 5.5.\n\nFound by #775 (cloud/r775-fable, Fable 5.2). Reviewed at `dev-swift` @ `7a61018f`; read from the code, not run on a device unless stated.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
