   "body": "/claim cloud/m4q-reliab-opus\n\nRe-verified at `dev-swift` @ `fa96c1c1`: `NavigationModel.isLoggedIn()` still trusts `forums.loader.value?.isLoggedIn` first; a re-login of an existing account renews the same `HFRSession` (no `currentSessionGeneration` bump), and the forum list reloads only on pull-to-refresh.\n\nPlan:\n- `AccountsModel.currentSessionChanges`: bumped when the current account's session changes in place (re-login of that account, adopted synced credentials, a check that finds it expired).\n- `ForumListModel`: `sessionDidChange()` marks its page as no longer saying whether the account is signed in and reloads it; `isLoggedIn` is nil until a load started after that applies. `NavigationModel.isLoggedIn()` reads it, else the session.\n- `RootNavigationView` observes the counter and calls `RootModel.currentSessionChanged()`: the forum list, then the topic lists on screen in both tabs, reload.\n- Tests first: `NavigationModelTests.aReloginInPlaceMakesTheListsLoggedInWithoutAManualRefresh` (+ a failed reload falls back to the session), `AccountsModelLoginTests` for the counter.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
